title: Game Over
new-page: true
go-to: eg_menu
on-arrival: {!
Q.game_over = 1;
this.achieve('game_completed');
if (Q.in_CHP_majority) this.achieve('majority_party');
if (Q.CHP_in_government) this.achieve('in_government');
if (Q.peoples_party) this.achieve('peoples_party');
if (Q.constitutional_reform > 0) this.achieve('constitutional_reform');
if (Q.economy_health >= 0 && Q.budget >= 0) this.achieve('economic_stability');
if (Q.womens_rights >= 3) this.achieve('equality');
if (Q.homosexual_rights >= 2) this.achieve('equal_rights');
if (Q.land_reform >= 3) this.achieve('land_reform');
if (Q.cyprus_problem == 2) this.achieve('cyprus_agreement');
if (Q.economic_democracy >= 3) this.achieve('economic_democracy');
!}

= End

@eg_menu

= The End of This Playthrough

- #endings
- @achievements: View achievements.
- @end_game: End game.

@coup
title: An army coup ends our democratic programme.
view-if: coup_timer >= 15
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

The armed forces intervene under [+ generalstaff +]. Parliamentary government is interrupted, and the future of the reforms we pursued is uncertain.

@CHP_victorious
title: CHP remains in government.
view-if: CHP_in_government = 1 and coup_timer < 15
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

CHP remains in government under Prime Minister [+ prime_minister +]. Our programme will continue to face political, economic and institutional challenges.

@opposition
title: CHP continues in opposition.
view-if: CHP_in_government = 0 and coup_timer < 15
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

CHP remains outside government. Our organization and the support we built will shape the next stage of the struggle for social democratic reform.

@economy
title: The economic record.
tags: endings
go-to: eg_menu

Inflation: [+ inflation +]%. Unemployment: [+ unemployed +]%. Growth: [+ economic_growth +]%. Economic health: [+ health_economy_status +].

@achievements
title: Achievements
go-to: eg_menu if started = 1 and game_over = 1; root if started = 1 and game_over = 0; root.start_menu_2 if started = 0

= Completed Achievements

[? if achievement_game_completed : **A Political Journey**, Finish a playthrough. ?]

[? if achievement_majority_party : **A Majority for CHP**, Form a CHP majority government. ?]

[? if achievement_in_government : **Responsibility for Government**, End a playthrough with CHP in government. ?]

[? if achievement_peoples_party : **A People's Party**, Adopt the broader party programme. ?]

[? if achievement_constitutional_reform : **Parliamentary Reform**, Pass a constitutional reform. ?]

[? if achievement_economic_stability : **Economic Stability**, Finish with stable economic health and a nonnegative budget. ?]

[? if achievement_equality : **Equality**, Pass at least three reforms for women’s rights. ?]

[? if achievement_equal_rights : **Equal Rights**, Pass at least two reforms for sexual minorities. ?]

[? if achievement_land_reform : **Reform in the Countryside**, Reach the third stage of land reform. ?]

[? if achievement_cyprus_agreement : **An Agreement for Cyprus**, Reach the confederation outcome. ?]

[? if achievement_economic_democracy : **Economic Democracy**, Reach at least three stages of economic democracy. ?]

@end_game
game-over: true
